  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.QuestDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nQuestDB OASIS Provider — high-performance time-series database for OASIS holons and avatars via QuestDB REST API. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Add bounded QuestDB CQL with native identity and UTF8 budget checks (c63b488)\n- Fix QuestDB acknowledged holon saves and batch failure ownership (cafc13d)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n- Validate QuestDB native WAL dedup schema without implicit DDL (7f59c5e)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.QuestDBOASIS",
